# Root-level ignores.
#
# NOTE: airgrid/.gitignore only governs the airgrid/ subtree. Signing material
# and scratch files live at the repository root, so they need rules here.
# A correct rule in the wrong scope is the same as no rule.

# ── Signing material — never commit ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
key.properties
key.properties.bak
release-signing/

# ── Device logs (contain real mesh node UUIDs) ───────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

# ── One-off codemod scratch scripts ──────────────────────────────────────────
patch*.js
patch*.dart
fix_*.ps1
test.txt
